WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.101
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.135
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.170
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.905
And now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:09.275
Former president Barack Obama
today visited the White House.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.112
And out of habit, Jeanine Pirro
called for his impeachment.

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.047
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:16.882
During a Zoom call last summer

00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:19.485
with a group
of presidential historians,

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:22.756
former president Trump
reportedly imitated the accent

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.690
of the president of South Korea.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.592
Alright, I'm not surprised

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.894
he did something
horribly offensive.

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:30.997
I am a little surprised
he did it

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:34.834
on a call with
presidential historians.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.869
[ As Trump ] So, you guys
will be evaluating me

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:38.037
for posterity, right?

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.606
Okay.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:43.076
Then you're gonna love this.
Two lesbians walk into a bar.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:44.978
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.047
[ Normal voice ]
President Biden said yesterday

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.148
that Russian president
Vladimir Putin

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.783
should face a war crimes trial

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:52.751
for his recent actions
in Ukraine.

00:00:52.751 --> 00:00:55.755
Good luck to whoever pulls that
in jury duty.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:56.822
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:58.057
"Is there any reason

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.193
why you shouldn't be selected
for this case?"

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:03.029
"Um, I got a wife and kids."

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.598
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:08.034
The Senate Judiciary
Committee's vote

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:11.136
to move Ketanji Brown Jackson's
nomination out of committee

00:01:11.136 --> 00:01:14.774
was delayed yesterday because
California senator Alex Padilla

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.676
was forced to switch
to a later flight.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:19.511
Look, I don't care if the fate
of the Supreme Court

00:01:19.511 --> 00:01:20.946
hangs in the balance.

00:01:20.946 --> 00:01:24.250
They offer you $400 in
flight credits, you take it.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.985
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.887
Probably a food voucher.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.156
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.791
An environmental group
said in a new report

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:35.728
that it cleaned up nearly
half a million pieces of trash

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.396
last year
from New Jersey beaches,

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:39.431
including a fake eyeball.

00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:42.368
Wow.
I am shocked.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.770
That it was fake.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.773
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.308
I mean, I feel like most days
you go to the Jersey Shore,

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:50.743
you're seeing a real eyeball.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:54.147
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.115
The environmental group
also reported

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:59.618
finding male enhancement pills
and a glow-in-the-dark condom,

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:02.755
or as it's known in New Jersey,
solid Tuesday night.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:06.359
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:09.595
According to a new study,
regular Fox News viewers

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:11.798
who were paid to watch CNN
for 30 days

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:15.268
became more skeptical and less
likely to believe fake news.

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.270
Said one participant,
"Before this,

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.573
I didn't even know some women
had brown hair."

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:23.476
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.445
Crazy.

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:27.346
According to the latest numbers,

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:30.115
the average price for a slice
of pizza in New York City

00:02:30.115 --> 00:02:32.518
is now more expensive
than riding the subway.

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:34.487
And for both things,
it's a good idea

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:37.322
to soak up the grease
with a napkin first.

00:02:37.322 --> 00:02:40.025
[ Laughter, groaning ]

00:02:40.025 --> 00:02:42.828
I mean, I don't --
I don't quite know what we're --

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:45.398
what we want from the audience
when we tell a joke like that.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:47.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:51.203
That was a very fair and
accurate response by all of you.

00:02:51.203 --> 00:02:54.773
Every now and then, we like
to set the levels, you know.

00:02:54.773 --> 00:02:58.044
We don't say a joke so much
as just a truly disgusting idea.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:00.246
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.647 --> 00:03:04.116
According to a new survey,
16% of Americans

00:03:04.116 --> 00:03:06.519
live in the same city or town
that they grew up in.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:09.422
The other 84% have them muted
on Facebook.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:11.857
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.857 --> 00:03:15.061
In anticipation
of legal marijuana

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.763
being available later this year,

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.998
New York governor Kathy Hochul
yesterday

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:21.767
unveiled the state's
Cannabis Conversations campaign,

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.670
which I'm guessing is that thing
where the edible kicks in

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.739
and you end up
debating your cat.

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:30.109
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:32.011
"I think you're hard
to be around."

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:34.347
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.757 --> 00:03:45.892
"Okay."

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.526
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.526 --> 00:03:49.328
The "New York Post"
recently reported

00:03:49.328 --> 00:03:52.298
that at least 139 people
around the country

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.699
have said they became sick

00:03:53.699 --> 00:03:56.235
after eating the breakfast
cereal Lucky Charms,

00:03:56.235 --> 00:03:58.705
or as they're now known,
just Charms.

00:03:58.705 --> 00:04:01.240
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.541
A restaurant in Florida

00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:04.877
reportedly canceled
a dinner reservation recently

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:07.513
after discovering the gathering
was a going-away party

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.715
for a Capitol rioter
who was sentenced to prison.

00:04:09.715 --> 00:04:13.252
Alright, but don't be shocked
if they show up anyway.

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:15.388
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:20.292
And finally, authorities
in Florida announced yesterday

00:04:20.292 --> 00:04:21.761
that they arrested six men

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:24.797
who allegedly stole thousands
of dollars' worth of gasoline

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.198
from several gas stations.

00:04:26.198 --> 00:04:29.368
They would have gotten away, but
thousands of dollars of gasoline

00:04:29.368 --> 00:04:31.504
was still only
like a quarter tank.

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:33.105
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.105 --> 00:04:34.574
That was the monologue,
everybody.

